  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is lightly browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the turmeric, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the water to the pan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Use a grill or grill pan to lightly char the onion mixture.",
    "Serve the kik alicha hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
